  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9b066c7d-199b-4081-a9a1-ffcd2f948c7c.png\" alt=\"DJSOA\" width=\"951\" height=\"219\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>🌌 <span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><strong>V<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">oidflare 银河 PvP 天穹</span></strong></span></p>\n<p>在这款简洁的银河主题天穹下，于璀璨星云与遥远星辰间战斗。专为 PvP 设计 &mdash; 无阳光眩光，无视觉杂乱，只有深邃太空的氛围与纯粹的专注体验。</p>\n<p>非常适合 Bed Wars、SkyWars 以及任何对天空视野有要求的竞技模式。</p>\n<p>编辑更新：非常感谢大家达到 1,200 次下载。感谢支持！</p>\n<p>⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻⸻</p>\n<p>🔧 <span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>所需依赖</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a>&nbsp;或&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nuit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nuit（原 FabricSkyboxes）模组</a>&nbsp;或&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foptiboxes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optiboxes 模组</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>同样可在&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fvoidflare-galaxy-skybox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></span></strong></span></p>",
